  articleID: https://NewManilaNews/Latest
  title: President Arrested
  headliner: <b>Former Strongman President Rodriguez D. Dirty Arrested At Airport</b>
  bodyText: "Former President Rodriguez D. Dirty was taken into police custody immediately
    upon landing at New Manila International Airport this morning and placed on a
    chartered flight to The Hague to face crimes against humanity charges before
    the World Criminal Tribunal \r"
  textBeforeUrl: 'More about this story :'
  externalLinkBodyText: The dramatic tarmac arrest executed via an international
    police warrant stemming from his bloody, years-long anti-narcotics crackdown
    caught the former leader's entourage off guard just minutes after returning from
    an overseas rally.
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - AND STAY THERE, TILL YOU ROT !
  - But D. Dirty didn't do me dirty, why was he arrested ?
  - And I bet his dirty deeds were done dirt cheap !
  - '#BringHimHome'
